## 1. What every winner gets (same at all 24 universities)

Official FAQ on [od.globaluni.ru](https://od.globaluni.ru/):

| Provided | You still pay |
| -------- | ------------- |
| **100% tuition** (Russian Government quota) | Flight Pakistan → Russia |
| **Monthly stipend** (amount is set by the university; ask them after you win) | Food, phone, transport, personal costs |
| **Dorm is usually offered** and is cheap; you still pay a small monthly dorm fee | Full private rent if you refuse the dorm |
| **Free 1-year Russian prep** if the degree is taught in Russian | Medical insurance, visa / document fees |

This is **tuition-free**, not “everything paid.”  
Moscow and St. Petersburg cost more to live in than Novosibirsk, Tomsk, Kazan, or Yekaterinburg.

**Rule on the form:** select **up to 6** universities. **At least one must be an Organizing University.**  
If #1 has no seat in your field, they move you to #2, then #3.

