### 6) Moscow Institute of Physics and Technology (MIPT)

- **City:** Moscow region (Dolgoprudny)  
- **Open Doors name:** `Moscow Institute of Physics and Technology (National Research University)`  
- **Field fit:** Strong CS, more math / algorithms than industry coding  
- **English Master’s to check:** MIPT lists English graduate programs in **01.04.02 Applied Mathematics and Informatics** and Computer Science tracks (algorithms, software systems). Start here: [MIPT Open Doors](https://opendoors.mipt.ru/en) · [MIPT English](https://eng.mipt.ru/) · [Master’s (older English list)](https://old.mipt.ru/english/edu/master/)  
- **What they provide:** Open Doors tuition + stipend + campus dorms. Harder academically; good if you want algorithms + research.  
- **Watch out:** many famous MIPT CS tracks are still **Russian**. If the English group is full, you can take the free prep year.

**Check yourself:** on the program card confirm **English**, not only “Computer Science.”

